locked": false, "text": "Given current context and data source, can we do the task? ", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Given current context and data source, can we do the task? ", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "L0sHO7Ro_vlqa2-fKYJq5", "type": "text", "x": 613.597749528965, "y": 344.0002334764752, "width": 131.39186096191406, "height": 20, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "b20", "roundness": null, "seed": 628637702, "version": 424, "versionNonce": 1174363526, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"id": "9zT-xXGXgo6qI9Qxf0Vpu", "type": "arrow"}], "updated": 1777336041099, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "JL: This is xxxx.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "JL: This is xxxx.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "9zT-xXGXgo6qI9Qxf0Vpu", "type": "arrow", "x": 746.6621939507883, "y": 354.6971798105914, "width": 254.19274611937146, "height": 17.132103952283217, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "b21", "roundness": {"type": 2}, "seed": 1703430278, "version": 376, "versionNonce": 444972230, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1777336041100, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [254.19274611937146, 17.132103952283217]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": {"elementId": "L0sHO7Ro_vlqa2-fKYJq5", "focus": -0.26640012875164587, "gap": 1.6725834599091058}, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow", "elbowed": false}, {"id": "a9ba1afc9df246c5b3d0", "type": "text", "x": -2051.8132909362303, "y": 848.9000049176184, "width": 400, "height": 20, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 0, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 0, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 0, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "CC: Agreed — the orchestrator is the load-bearing skill that drives the entire session loop. Pinning its interface contract first will prevent downstream skill misalignment.", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "CC: Agreed — the orchestrator is the load-bearing skill that drives the entire session loop. Pinning its interface contract first will prevent downstream skill misalignment.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "0eeabad4c91144f6a505", "type": "text", "x": -2063.204789984562, "y": 1142.550942832102, "width": 400, "height": 20, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 0, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 0, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 0, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "CC: Good clarification — easily mispronounced as \"tie-er\" in non-native contexts. Worth keeping as a shared reference.", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "CC: Good clarification — easily mispronounced as \"tie-er\" in non-native contexts. Worth keeping as a shared reference.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "4740b2c253ba4772a7b5", "type": "text", "x": -1985.8865772625857, "y": 1019.269594131389, "width": 595.6315307617188, "height": 20, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 0, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 0, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 0, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "CC: Makes sense — both are cross-cutting support skills, not phase owners. Tier 2 keeps them callable from any phase without creating ownership conflicts.", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "CC: Makes sense — both are cross-cutting support skills, not phase owners. Tier 2 keeps them callable from any phase without creating ownership conflicts.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "090fdfa56b1f4621b122", "type": "text", "x": -1270.5277719897304, "y": 2114.5119853026185, "width": 400, "height": 20, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 0, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 0, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 0, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "CC: Incremental content matters for crash recovery and audit trails, but likely not for gate decisions. Worth separating \"what the gate reads\" from \"what gets persisted per step.\"", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "CC: Incremental content matters for crash recovery and audit trails, but likely not for gate decisions. Worth separating \"what the gate reads\" from \"what gets persisted per step.\"", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "2a3ffb09aa96432585ee", "type": "text", "x": -275.93565074313597, "y": 1109.342511544278, "width": 517.7435302734375, "height": 20, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 0, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 0, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 0, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "CC: Strong framing. Binary output (forward / back-to-plan) keeps gate decisions auditable and avoids partial-progress ambiguity.", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "CC: Strong framing. Binary output (forward / back-to-plan) keeps gate decisions auditable and avoids partial-progress ambiguity.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "f93bba45f0374cdfa053", "type": "text", "x": -145.11043067241144, "y": 1200.7598252141956, "width": 400, "height": 20, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 0, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 0, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 0, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "CC: This axis is orthogonal to gate logic — the gate runs the same reasoning either way; only the confirmation step differs. Model as a flag on the gate call.", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "CC: This axis is orthogonal to gate logic — the gate runs the same reasoning either way; only the confirmation step differs. Model as a flag on the gate call.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "729e5559cdea47c498de", "type": "text", "x": 2617.870903200744, "y": 534.3100308349765, "width": 482.15966796875, "height": 20, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 0, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 0, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 0, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "CC: This anchors the gate as a feasibility check, not a quality check. Quality belongs in the task step itself — keeping these separate avoids role confusion.", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "CC: This anchors the gate as a feasibility check, not a quality check. Quality belongs in the task step itself — keeping these separate avoids role confusion.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "ed56beaa2cd84a4aa654", "type": "text", "x": 613.597749528965, "y": 372.0002334764752, "width": 400, "height": 20, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 0, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 0, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 0, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "CC: Placeholder — fill in when the concept solidifies.", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "CC: Placeholder — fill in when the concept solidifies.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}], "appState": {"gridSize": 20, "gridStep": 5, "gridModeEnabled": false, "viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff"}, "files": {"b39c6595215ee6af79df541aba89e60bb59848b1": {"mimeType": "image/png", "id": "b39c6595215ee6af79df541aba89e60bb59848b1", "dataURL": "data:image/png;base64,", "created": 1777154741957, "lastRetrieved": 1777154741957}, "65a60906052a54025e121bacb4616f1b398ac832": {"mimeType": "image/png", "id": "65a60906052a54025e121bacb4616f1b398ac832", "dataURL": "data:image/png;base64,", "created": 1777154741957, "lastRetrieved": 1777154741957}, "bdc44a8112ec12fcef